"texts":{
"czLimit":"YOU HAVE REACHED THE MAX WIN!",
"diamondTreeJp":"Diamond Tree JACKPOT<br>After the end of each paid game the player has a chance of triggering the Jackpot Bonus. If 3, 4, 5 or 6 diamonds appear on the screen, the Jackpot Bonus will trigger at the end of the current spin. After appearing 3, 4, 5 or 6 diamonds, the player has to press the START button to start the JACKPOT BONUS. During the bonus feature, a slot is played on 15 different micro-reels, and either a diamond or nothing can appear on each of the reels. At the beginning of the Bonus, the player is awarded 3 free spins, and if a new diamond appears during the spin on one of the micro-reels, the counter is reset to 3. Bonus Feature continues until no spins remain or all 15 reel positions are filled with diamonds. If all 15 reel positions are filled, the player is also paid an additional win of 500x the total bet. The fallen diamonds are held in position for the duration of the bonus. Each of the held diamonds has a win on it that is given to the player after the bonus has ended. The total bonus win is the sum of all the winnings on the collected diamonds at the end of the bonus.<br>Possible winnings on the diamonds are: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 50 x the total bet, in addition to the winning it is possible to have the inscription MINI, MAXI, MEGA which gives the corresponding level of the Jackpot. If there is a number in front of the inscription, then the corresponding jackpot level is given as many times as the number.",
"includingJackpot": " (Including Jackpot)",
"messJackpotTitle":"JACKPOT",
"progrJackpot":"PROGRESSIVE JACKPOT<br>The player can play for Progressive Jackpot only if max bet and max denomination are selected. If the progressive win combination is hit on more than one active line, only the first line pays the Progressive Jackpot, and the others pay the wins according to the pay table.<br>Progressive Jackpot is not multiplied even if there is a win multiplier.",

"messJackpot":"The game is linked to Mystery Jackpot.<br>At the end of each game the Player has a chance to win one of the<br>jackpot levels. The higher the bet, the higher the chance of winning<br>the jackpot.",

"messJackpotInt":"The game is connected to a mystery jackpot.<br>At the beginning of a new game, the player may enter a special bonus screen and play for one of the jackpot levels. The higher the bet is, the better are the chances of triggering the bonus.<br>30 plates appear on the screen. The player could start opening plates by clicking on them one by one in an order chosen by him.<br>Alternatively, the player could press SPACE or ENTER when a plate illuminates, and the plate will open.<br>When opening a plate with the symbol of one of the jackpot levels, that same symbol is attached to the corresponding level. When gathering 4 same symbols, the player wins the level to which the symbols match. The player is awarded the level, and the bonus ends.<br>The jackpot bonus has a time limitation that is shown with a time counter. If the player exceeds the time or the connection is lost, the jackpot bonus session is finalized automatically by random selections.<br>If the game is unfinished, the jackpot is not lost. The player can return to the game and play it. If it is not possible, the operator may finalise the game, and the jackpot will be added to the player's credit.<br>",
